name    mod-dungeon-challenge: a full boss clear of Turtle Karazhan Crypt (800) completes the run
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Karazhan Crypt is staged `enabled = 0` in dungeon_challenge_dungeons with
# boss_count 7; this checks the boss list (dungeon_challenge_boss_entry plus rank 3) before it is enabled: the
# director kills every listed boss with `.die` in a level-1 run (uplift 80); the run must end cleared, with every kill
# credited. `.dchallenge start` only knows enabled dungeons: the test window sets `enabled = 1` and restarts, and a
# dungeon whose scenario fails goes back to `enabled = 0`.
timeout 300s

bot a warrior
group party

place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
require a alive
as gm .cheat god on
as gm .dchallenge start 800 1
expect output has "starting"
waitfor gm map 800 timeout 20s
wait 2s

log boss 1 - enk (930005)
do gm goto -11188.2 -1791.6 5.3
wait 2s
pick enk creature:930005 near gm
require enk exists
do gm target enk
as gm .die
waitfor enk dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 2 - corpse (930006)
do gm goto -11223.5 -1406.6 -14.4
wait 2s
pick corpse creature:930006 near gm
require corpse exists
do gm target corpse
as gm .die
waitfor corpse dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 3 - andreon (930008)
do gm goto -11064.3 -1541.6 28.9
wait 2s
pick andreon creature:930008 near gm
require andreon exists
do gm target andreon
as gm .die
waitfor andreon dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 4 - marrow (930009)
do gm goto -11214.6 -1800.2 -27.4
wait 2s
pick marrow creature:930009 near gm
require marrow exists
do gm target marrow
as gm .die
waitfor marrow dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 5 - hiv (930017)
do gm goto -11255 -1744.5 -14.7
wait 2s
pick hiv creature:930017 near gm
require hiv exists
do gm target hiv
as gm .die
waitfor hiv dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 6 - gort (930021)
do gm goto -11217 -1696.8 5.9
wait 2s
pick gort creature:930021 near gm
require gort exists
do gm target gort
as gm .die
waitfor gort dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log boss 7 - Alarus (930016), summoned by the crypt's rune event in play; spawned here by hand
as gm .npc add temp 930016
wait 2s
pick alarus creature:930016 near gm
require alarus exists
do gm target alarus
as gm .die
waitfor alarus dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log the run ended cleared with every boss credited
as gm .dchallenge status
expect output has "bosses 7/7"
expect output has "state 7"

cleanup
as gm .cheat god off
place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
